{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Five women. Three surfers. One island. A summer they\u2019ll never forget.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681750/extras/c701852d2e238e8bb312600340217fb8.avif?t=1754672329\" width=640 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Margaret thought her birthday celebration with her girlfriend Arabelle would be simple\u2014sun, laughter, and maybe a few stolen kisses by the beach. But things take a thrilling turn when Arabelle reveals her real birthday surprise: Morgan, a world-class surfer with magnetic charm and a body sculpted by waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the moment their eyes meet, Margaret feels a flutter in her chest\u2014a rush she hasn\u2019t felt since falling for Arabelle. It\u2019s confusing, it\u2019s thrilling... it feels like falling in love for the very first time all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681750/extras/6b905915b887adeef427a3b17f4ee33c.avif?t=1754672329\" width=640 height=228 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 beautifully hand-drawn characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning tropical scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light and casual story full of flirty moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue options and two unique endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your outfits \u2014 from sweet to sizzling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in fun beachside events and conquer everyone's hearts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill and romantic soundtrack to set the summer vibe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas